  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Support to National and State Disaster Management Authorities for Disaster Risk Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP will work with participating state governments and the NDMA and support the implementation of state-level disaster risk management programmes that will enable the states to access the resources allocated by the XV Finance Commission. This engagement will be through capacity building, institutional strengthening, development of detailed project reports (DPRs)s, risk assessments, post- disaster damage and loss assessments etc.</narrative>
  </description>
